,'협회소개','지회','지회 - 한국CM협회','협회소개','/cmak/intro/organization','<div class=\"sub-content-card\">\r\n<h2 class=\"sub-content-title\">지회</h2>\r\n<p class=\"sub-content-desc\">한국CM협회는 전국적으로 6개의 지회를 통해 운영되고 있습니다.</p>\r\n<!-- 인터랙티브 지회 도표 -->\r\n<div id=\"org-branch-map\" style=\"width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 4px 0 24px 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'Noto Sans KR\', \'Malgun Gothic\', sans-serif;\">\r\n<div style=\"min-width: 980px; max-width: 1050px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 16px; padding: 35px 25px 25px 25px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05); box-sizing: border-box;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 680\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;\">\r\n                <style>\r\n                    /* 트랜지션 애니메이션 복구 */\r\n                    #org-branch-map .map-base-path { transition: fill 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1), stroke 0.35s, stroke-width 0.35s; }\r\n                    #org-branch-map .connect-line { transition: stroke 0.35s, stroke-width 0.35s, stroke-dasharray 0.35s; }\r\n                    #org-branch-map .connect-dot { transition: fill 0.35s, r 0.35s; }\r\n                    #org-branch-map .box-bg { transition: fill 0.35s, stroke 0.35s, filter 0.35s; }\r\n                    #org-branch-map .box-title, #org-branch-map .box-desc { transition: fill 0.35s; }\r\n\r\n                    /* 기본 색상은 각 도형의 속성으로 지정됨. 아래는 호버 효과 전용 */\r\n                    #org-branch-map .branch-group:hover .connect-line {\r\n                        stroke-dasharray: 0;\r\n                        stroke-width: 2.5;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map .branch-group:hover .connect-dot {\r\n                        r: 6.5;\r\n                        stroke-width: 2;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-seoul:hover .map-base-path {\r\n                        fill: #3b82f6 !important;\r\n                        stroke: #ffffff !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-seoul:hover .box-bg {\r\n                        fill: #f0f9ff !important;\r\n                        stroke: #3b82f6 !important;\r\n                        filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15));\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-seoul:hover .box-title {\r\n                        fill: #1d4ed8 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-seoul:hover .box-desc {\r\n                        fill: #3b82f6 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-seoul:hover .connect-line {\r\n                        stroke: #3b82f6 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-seoul:hover .connect-dot {\r\n                        fill: #3b82f6 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-jungbu:hover .map-base-path {\r\n                        fill: #0ea5e9 !important;\r\n                        stroke: #ffffff !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-jungbu:hover .box-bg {\r\n                        fill: #f0f9ff !important;\r\n                        stroke: #0ea5e9 !important;\r\n                        filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.15));\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-jungbu:hover .box-title {\r\n                        fill: #0369a1 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-jungbu:hover .box-desc {\r\n                        fill: #0ea5e9 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-jungbu:hover .connect-line {\r\n                        stroke: #0ea5e9 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-jungbu:hover .connect-dot {\r\n                        fill: #0ea5e9 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-chungcheong:hover .map-base-path {\r\n                        fill: #f97316 !important;\r\n                        stroke: #ffffff !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-chungcheong:hover .box-bg {\r\n                        fill: #fff7ed !important;\r\n                        stroke: #f97316 !important;\r\n                        filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.15));\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-chungcheong:hover .box-title {\r\n                        fill: #c2410c !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-chungcheong:hover .box-desc {\r\n                        fill: #ea580c !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-chungcheong:hover .connect-line {\r\n                        stroke: #f97316 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-chungcheong:hover .connect-dot {\r\n                        fill: #f97316 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-honam:hover .map-base-path {\r\n                        fill: #10b981 !important;\r\n                        stroke: #ffffff !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-honam:hover .box-bg {\r\n                        fill: #f0fdf4 !important;\r\n                        stroke: #10b981 !important;\r\n                        filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15));\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-honam:hover .box-title {\r\n                        fill: #047857 !important;\r\n                    }\r\n                    #org-branch-map #branch-honam:hover .box-desc {\r\n                        fill: #059669 